    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/763a239eb00c651e92ac88b686697559.avif?t=1750515291\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to the world of A Building Full of Cats!<br><br>In this sequel, you won\u2019t just be petting every cat in the building\u2014you\u2019ll also be lending a helping hand to its quirky residents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/8af366120a9dd5835a9e3ff18a0acc12.poster.avif?t=1750515291\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/8af366120a9dd5835a9e3ff18a0acc12.webm?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/8af366120a9dd5835a9e3ff18a0acc12.mp4?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After all, what\u2019s better than cuddling cats and making a difference in people\u2019s lives?<br><br>Uncover hidden rooms, enjoy fun mini-games, and discover more cats than you can count (maybe?). It\u2019s the biggest Devcats game yet!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/1de64f3d2639a3d3a367330bdc712e81.poster.avif?t=1750515291\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/1de64f3d2639a3d3a367330bdc712e81.webm?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/1de64f3d2639a3d3a367330bdc712e81.mp4?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Than 2000 Cats! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the Residents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden rooms, uncover secrets, and find special items.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/763a239eb00c651e92ac88b686697559.avif?t=1750515291\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to the world of A Building Full of Cats!<br><br>In this sequel, you won\u2019t just be petting every cat in the building\u2014you\u2019ll also be lending a helping hand to its quirky residents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/8af366120a9dd5835a9e3ff18a0acc12.poster.avif?t=1750515291\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/8af366120a9dd5835a9e3ff18a0acc12.webm?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/8af366120a9dd5835a9e3ff18a0acc12.mp4?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After all, what\u2019s better than cuddling cats and making a difference in people\u2019s lives?<br><br>Uncover hidden rooms, enjoy fun mini-games, and discover more cats than you can count (maybe?). It\u2019s the biggest Devcats game yet!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/1de64f3d2639a3d3a367330bdc712e81.poster.avif?t=1750515291\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/1de64f3d2639a3d3a367330bdc712e81.webm?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810730/extras/1de64f3d2639a3d3a367330bdc712e81.mp4?t=1750515291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Than 2000 Cats! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the Residents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden rooms, uncover secrets, and find special items.</p></li></ul>",
